WEBVTT

00:03.950 --> 00:05.460
Excuse me.

00:05.460 --> 00:08.790
I am Fujiwara no Teika, from the
Heian Special Police Force.

00:08.790 --> 00:10.550
This is my partner.

00:11.050 --> 00:12.530
I am Yoritsuna, from Forensics.

00:13.300 --> 00:16.290
Teika-san, please take a look at this.

00:20.550 --> 00:23.030
They say that this man,
Fujiwara no Yukinari,

00:23.030 --> 00:26.300
hasn't smiled since he was a child.

00:26.300 --> 00:28.780
Is that true, Yoritsuna-kun?

00:28.780 --> 00:31.620
I lack concrete evidence
at this point...

00:31.620 --> 00:33.060
I understand.

00:33.060 --> 00:34.550
Let's investigate further.

02:07.020 --> 02:10.690
My father, Fujiwara no Yoshitaka,

02:10.690 --> 02:12.190
died when I was only three.

02:13.000 --> 02:16.530
I was told that he was a
good person and poet.

02:17.380 --> 02:21.870
I worked hard to learn poetry and
fulfill everyone's expectations.

02:22.330 --> 02:26.700
Well, this poem is pretty good,
but it's nothing special.

02:27.220 --> 02:30.870
Unlike my father, I had no
natural talent for poetry.

02:37.900 --> 02:39.540
Good morning, Yukinari-kun.

02:40.930 --> 02:43.050
Good morning, Tadanobu-sama.

02:43.510 --> 02:45.060
You're always up early.

02:45.650 --> 02:48.080
I like to get an early start.

02:48.080 --> 02:49.420
You're a hard worker.

02:49.950 --> 02:53.390
In that case, why don't you
come to the palace with me?

02:53.390 --> 02:54.480
Yes.

02:56.200 --> 02:58.160
Good morning!

02:58.160 --> 02:59.200
Yes, good morning.

02:59.200 --> 03:02.150
Oh?  Yukinari-sama is with you today?

03:03.870 --> 03:07.430
Yukinari-kun, you need
to be more social.

03:08.930 --> 03:11.360
You should start visiting the
inner palace more often.

03:11.360 --> 03:14.260
If you aren't on good terms
with the ladies, you'll regret it.

03:16.040 --> 03:17.960
You had to work hard

03:17.960 --> 03:19.970
after your father's death to
earn your current position.

03:20.660 --> 03:23.640
It would be foolish to let something
silly ruin your reputation.

03:24.040 --> 03:26.730
I'll introduce you to a
wonderful lady today.

03:27.350 --> 03:29.100
Sei Shonagon of the Plum Court.

03:29.810 --> 03:32.250
The daughter of Kiyohara no Motosuke?

03:32.740 --> 03:35.730
Yes, Teishi-sama trusts
her a great deal.

03:35.730 --> 03:38.320
She's bright, so you can trust
her to handle any request.

03:39.180 --> 03:43.510
Also, she likes to say good
things about her friends.

03:44.250 --> 03:46.410
It's worth your while to
make her acquaintance.

03:50.500 --> 03:52.160
Please call for Shonagon.

03:53.140 --> 03:56.450
The daughter of Motosuke-dono,
who is known for her poetry...

03:57.390 --> 04:00.190
I hope she doesn't begin
reciting poems.

04:00.190 --> 04:04.650
Why do you need me this
early in the morning?

04:04.650 --> 04:05.690
Oh, I'm sorry.

04:05.690 --> 04:07.870
There's someone I want
to introduce to you.

04:08.390 --> 04:12.390
The new Head Chamberlain,
Fujiwara no Yukinari-kun.

04:13.510 --> 04:15.510
Oh, the other court ladies

04:15.510 --> 04:17.670
have been eagerly awaiting your arrival,

04:17.670 --> 04:21.060
so it would be inappropriate
for you to introduce only me.

04:21.060 --> 04:23.020
Sounds like you're
popular with the girls.

04:23.020 --> 04:26.090
Unfortunately, I am unfamiliar with
romantic practices and customs,

04:26.090 --> 04:28.060
so I will not be able to
meet their expectations.

04:28.060 --> 04:29.450
So modest.

04:29.450 --> 04:33.540
The family of Lord Kentoku
has produced many poets.

04:33.540 --> 04:35.840
Surely you are an accomplished poet as well?

04:36.380 --> 04:39.180
No, I'm not much of a poet.

04:39.180 --> 04:41.630
It would be unsightly for me
to continue writing poems.

04:41.630 --> 04:42.810
I understand what you mean.

04:43.740 --> 04:46.510
You know how my family has produced poets

04:46.510 --> 04:48.290
since my great-grandfather's generation?

04:48.290 --> 04:51.060
It's difficult when your
parents are great people.

04:51.060 --> 04:54.490
Your father is the reason
you're here, though.

04:54.490 --> 04:57.240
Perhaps, but it would be disgraceful to

04:57.240 --> 04:59.950
use the influence of your parents
to create something mediocre.

05:00.860 --> 05:01.650
I agree.

05:02.710 --> 05:05.990
I do not wish to sully my father's
name with my poor poetry.

05:07.150 --> 05:08.410
Exactly.

05:09.160 --> 05:11.200
Say, Yukinari-sama,

05:11.200 --> 05:13.620
I believe we could become friends.

05:14.200 --> 05:16.920
If you truly do not like
poetry, that is...

05:17.390 --> 05:20.750
Yes, I am not very fond of poetry.

05:21.720 --> 05:23.990
That was my first meeting
with Sei Shonagon.

05:25.670 --> 05:28.680
Shonagon and Yukinari

05:25.670 --> 05:28.680
Sei Shonagon

05:29.760 --> 05:31.930
It sounds like you're getting
along well with Shonagon.

05:32.280 --> 05:34.100
Yes, I suppose...

05:34.100 --> 05:36.030
The court ladies have been complaining.

05:36.810 --> 05:40.060
You always ask her to
carry your messages.

05:40.630 --> 05:41.610
Well...

05:41.610 --> 05:43.550
Oh, it's Sanekata-dono.

05:44.200 --> 05:45.900
Fujiwara no Sanekata-sama?

05:46.260 --> 05:48.660
Yes, he's quite handsome.

05:49.380 --> 05:50.880
He's Shonagon's former lover.

05:52.690 --> 05:55.750
Once, we were flower-watching
when it began to rain.

05:56.010 --> 05:57.760
While everyone else
scrambled to take cover,

05:57.760 --> 05:59.540
he stood alone in the rain.

06:00.900 --> 06:03.920
Caught in a shower as
I seek cherry blossoms,

06:03.920 --> 06:06.710
if I am wet regardless, I prefer to

06:06.710 --> 06:08.250
stand in the shade of the wet petals.

06:09.180 --> 06:11.040
If I'm going to get wet anyway,

06:11.040 --> 06:13.270
I would rather stay under
the cherry blossom tree.

06:13.270 --> 06:15.500
That was the poem he recited.

06:17.980 --> 06:20.430
That was an impressive performance.

06:20.430 --> 06:21.470
Really?

06:21.470 --> 06:22.400
Huh?

06:22.840 --> 06:26.900
I believe that his performance
was too artificial.

06:27.280 --> 06:29.850
Well, it looked good when he did it.

06:30.180 --> 06:32.840
Sanekata-sama must be a fool,

06:32.840 --> 06:35.180
if he chose to stand in the rain.

06:35.180 --> 06:35.910
Come on...

06:36.560 --> 06:38.270
You're too harsh.

06:38.270 --> 06:40.130
I was merely stating the truth.

06:41.330 --> 06:46.080
Oh, Yukinari-kun can be very cruel.

06:46.080 --> 06:47.650
Are you upset now?

06:47.650 --> 06:48.130
No.

06:48.680 --> 06:50.570
I'm impressed, actually.

06:50.570 --> 06:51.650
Excuse me.

06:52.390 --> 06:54.970
I have a message for Kinto-sama.

06:54.970 --> 06:56.240
I'll listen to it here.

06:56.240 --> 06:57.370
Come inside.

06:57.370 --> 06:58.350
Yes.

07:02.880 --> 07:04.400
Oh, Yukinari.

07:04.400 --> 07:07.440
I was just talking about you with Sanekata,

07:07.440 --> 07:09.300
the man you called a fool.

07:10.520 --> 07:13.390
The Empress has requested
your presence in her palace.

07:13.390 --> 07:14.390
I see.

07:14.390 --> 07:16.480
Why don't you have a seat
and join our conversation?

07:16.480 --> 07:18.710
No, I have other pressing
matters to attend to.

07:18.710 --> 07:20.330
It won't take long.

07:20.330 --> 07:21.440
Why don't you stay?

07:21.440 --> 07:25.310
Kinto, you're being silly.

07:25.310 --> 07:28.410
He and I are too mature
to let you provoke us.

07:28.410 --> 07:29.810
A pity.

07:29.810 --> 07:31.880
I was hoping for some entertainment
before you set off.

07:32.680 --> 07:34.390
Are you departing?

07:34.390 --> 07:36.580
I'll be leaving for Mutsu soon.

07:36.580 --> 07:37.760
I apologize.

07:39.020 --> 07:42.390
Kinto enjoys mischief,
but he's a good person.

07:43.120 --> 07:44.510
I hope you can be friends.

07:46.520 --> 07:47.870
I'll be leaving, then.

07:46.660 --> 07:47.840
He's very grown-up.

07:47.870 --> 07:49.800
Say "goodbye" to my sister for me.

07:48.340 --> 07:49.800
He shrugged off my insults and

07:49.800 --> 07:51.760
behaves like a perfect gentleman.

07:49.800 --> 07:51.800
Yes, farewell.

07:53.180 --> 07:55.660
This is Shonagon's former lover...

07:59.640 --> 08:01.380
Oh, sorry.

08:01.380 --> 08:05.090
I didn't realize you were...
following me out...

08:08.820 --> 08:12.840
At the time, exposing your hair was as
embarrassing as exposing your underwear.

08:13.890 --> 08:15.590
Yu-Yukinari-kun?

08:17.300 --> 08:19.210
Please ignore what just happened.

08:19.210 --> 08:20.140
If you'll excuse me.

08:20.910 --> 08:21.840
Yes...

08:25.280 --> 08:27.170
That guy is a riot!

08:28.660 --> 08:31.440
I'm pleased to hear that you were
able to control your anger.

08:32.090 --> 08:34.310
Can you please forget
that it ever happened?

08:34.310 --> 08:35.610
That would be impossible.

08:35.610 --> 08:38.450
Everyone in the palace
is talking about it.

08:38.830 --> 08:43.970
My father once fell off his
horse and lost his cap,

08:43.970 --> 08:49.640
but he calmly said he was bald, so it was
only natural for his cap to fall off.

08:49.640 --> 08:51.310
I'm not bald.

08:51.310 --> 08:56.010
In any case, a man is judged
by how he reacts in a crisis.

08:56.490 --> 09:00.340
In other words, you passed the test.

09:00.340 --> 09:01.950
Then I deserve a reward.

09:01.950 --> 09:02.680
Huh?

09:03.220 --> 09:05.690
Put away the fan and
let me see your face.

09:06.030 --> 09:08.340
H-How could you ask such a thing?!

09:08.340 --> 09:09.850
Absolutely not!

09:10.260 --> 09:11.190
I was joking.

09:11.880 --> 09:13.170
Honestly...

09:13.170 --> 09:14.820
You always joke with a straight face.

09:15.610 --> 09:18.740
Shonagon always kept her distance.

09:20.460 --> 09:22.990
Soon after the new year began,

09:22.990 --> 09:24.620
there was an accident.

09:26.840 --> 09:28.900
Empress Teishi's brother accidentally

09:28.900 --> 09:31.400
shot the former Emperor with an arrow.

09:31.400 --> 09:32.720
As punishment,

09:35.700 --> 09:39.260
Teishi-sama, who was carrying
the Emperor's child,

09:39.960 --> 09:41.990
was forced to leave the palace.

09:44.480 --> 09:47.310
The Naka no Kanpaku clan has been losing

09:47.310 --> 09:48.760
its overwhelming influence

09:48.760 --> 09:50.270
since the death of Michitaka-sama.

09:50.270 --> 09:52.940
Michinaga-sama intends
to send Teishi-sama off

09:52.940 --> 09:55.500
and make his own daughter
the new Empress.

09:56.310 --> 09:59.320
I heard that Sei Shonagon has also left.

09:59.610 --> 10:02.470
I suppose that Michinaga-sama
will be in control now.

10:10.440 --> 10:11.900
Nagiko-sama.

10:11.900 --> 10:12.890
Yes?

10:12.890 --> 10:15.880
Fujiwara no Yukinari-sama
has brought a message.

10:16.460 --> 10:18.090
Yukinari-sama has?!

10:18.880 --> 10:22.470
Did he come here at this
late hour to see me?

10:22.470 --> 10:24.470
No, that can't be it.

10:25.270 --> 10:27.650
In any case, he must
have urgent business.

10:29.240 --> 10:31.790
What brings you here so late at night?

10:31.790 --> 10:32.980
I have an update report.

10:34.130 --> 10:36.490
Please give this to the Empress.

10:36.490 --> 10:37.600
What?

10:37.600 --> 10:41.240
You came out to the
village to give me that?

10:41.240 --> 10:41.870
Yes.

10:42.310 --> 10:44.380
You could have asked one
of the other ladies...

10:44.380 --> 10:45.870
I will never ask for another lady.

10:49.250 --> 10:50.370
Sei Shonagon-dono...

10:50.900 --> 10:54.290
I will be unable to perform
my job if you aren't around.

10:57.870 --> 11:01.060
Teishi-sama and Sei Shonagon
returned to the palace

11:01.060 --> 11:02.780
the following year.

11:08.920 --> 11:11.200
The court had high hopes for the new

11:11.200 --> 11:15.570
Head Chamberlain, Yukinari-sama,
son of Yoshitaka-sama.

11:15.570 --> 11:16.440
However...

11:16.730 --> 11:19.500
Yukinari-sama is difficult to work with.

11:19.500 --> 11:21.200
Yes, I'm disappointed.

11:21.500 --> 11:23.140
This is how he's viewed now.

11:24.850 --> 11:26.680
What do you think, Shonagon?

11:26.680 --> 11:27.330
Huh?

11:29.260 --> 11:33.520
Well, I agree that he's
stuffy and not very social,

11:33.520 --> 11:36.670
but he works hard, and
he's an interesting person

11:36.670 --> 11:38.670
once you get to know him.

11:36.670 --> 11:38.670
I can't think of anything
good to say about him.

11:38.860 --> 11:41.650
We can't get to know him because

11:41.650 --> 11:43.250
he always goes to you, Shonagon.

11:43.250 --> 11:45.430
Is he in love with you?

11:45.790 --> 11:47.450
Is that true?

11:47.450 --> 11:50.320
I can't imagine that
square falling in love.

11:50.320 --> 11:53.930
He may be a square,
but he's still a man.

11:54.620 --> 11:59.000
Well, he can't be all bad
if you're taking his side.

12:01.360 --> 12:02.740
Excellent.

12:02.740 --> 12:05.870
We were able to preserve
Teishi-sama's dignity.

12:06.290 --> 12:09.670
Yukinari-sama, I have
some advice for you.

12:09.670 --> 12:12.830
You need to try harder to make
friends with the other ladies.

12:12.830 --> 12:13.570
I refuse.

12:14.140 --> 12:15.730
Y-You refuse?

12:15.730 --> 12:18.340
It's not my nature to value
quantity over quality.

12:19.230 --> 12:21.430
I value a single life-long friend

12:21.430 --> 12:25.270
over ten thousand casual acquaintances.

12:26.990 --> 12:29.460
I understand what you mean.

12:29.460 --> 12:31.950
However, you must keep business
and private affairs distinct.

12:33.220 --> 12:35.460
You need to stop being so stubborn.

12:35.460 --> 12:37.680
You seek to change my very soul.

12:37.680 --> 12:38.520
Huh?

12:38.820 --> 12:40.980
People can't change their innate nature.

12:41.380 --> 12:42.840
I was born stubborn.

12:43.310 --> 12:44.320
In that case...

12:44.320 --> 12:47.060
Never be afraid to correct.

12:47.060 --> 12:49.920
If something is wrong, you should
immediately try to fix it.

12:49.920 --> 12:51.950
Will you ignore this rule?

12:53.900 --> 12:55.040
I won.

12:56.030 --> 12:57.330
If you let me see your face...

12:57.760 --> 12:58.840
What?

12:58.840 --> 13:01.150
If you're going to insist that
I try to change my personality,

13:01.150 --> 13:03.090
you must show me that you are sincere.

13:03.610 --> 13:06.720
If you speak to me face-to-face,
I will consider your advice.

13:07.850 --> 13:09.940
Now, let me see your face.

13:09.940 --> 13:12.080
Th-That's enough!

13:12.080 --> 13:13.480
My sincere feelings

13:13.480 --> 13:15.730
wouldn't be able to sway
your stubborn mind.

13:16.060 --> 13:18.980
Yes, and my sincere feelings
have gone ignored.

13:20.350 --> 13:23.740
Well, I shall leave before
I upset you any further.

13:23.740 --> 13:25.200
Oh, do you have other business?

13:26.200 --> 13:27.730
I will be spending the
night in the office,

13:27.730 --> 13:29.300
so I don't want to be late.

13:29.300 --> 13:30.840
Honestly...

13:30.840 --> 13:33.520
Whenever I expect you to
overstay your welcome,

13:33.520 --> 13:36.420
you find an excuse to leave.

13:36.420 --> 13:38.080
Your manners are impeccable.

13:44.520 --> 13:47.520
You refuse to open up,
so I must gauge

13:47.520 --> 13:49.180
the appropriate distance to maintain.

13:49.680 --> 13:51.310
How would you respond to that?

13:51.890 --> 13:53.230
Enough of your babbling.

13:53.230 --> 13:55.100
Get going.

13:55.100 --> 13:56.410
Aren't you busy?

13:57.010 --> 13:59.760
Yes, then I'll see you shortly.

14:04.690 --> 14:07.590
You always defy expectation.

14:07.590 --> 14:10.050
I was hoping to tease you in the morning

14:10.050 --> 14:13.870
for allowing that man to escape tonight.

14:13.870 --> 14:17.830
Teishi-sama, Yukinari-sama
and I are only friends.

14:17.830 --> 14:19.470
Really?

14:19.470 --> 14:22.010
So these days, it's customary for

14:22.010 --> 14:24.050
male friends to visit your quarters.

14:24.050 --> 14:26.300
Y-Yes, so it seems.

14:26.300 --> 14:29.910
If you're so friendly,
you should get together.

14:29.910 --> 14:31.510
I think you would make
a wonderful couple.

14:31.510 --> 14:33.630
He's six years my junior.

14:33.630 --> 14:35.580
Everyone will laugh that an old woman

14:35.580 --> 14:37.730
was able to trick a young man.

14:38.070 --> 14:39.760
No, you have it backwards.

14:39.760 --> 14:43.900
A man loves to boast about how
lovely his wife is at any age.

14:43.900 --> 14:46.940
Is it not your duty
to make love blossom?

14:46.940 --> 14:49.510
You're always teasing me!

14:49.510 --> 14:52.340
Oh, dear.  You're so cynical.

14:52.340 --> 14:53.210
Really?

14:53.210 --> 14:56.280
You shouldn't give up on me
because I'm not very endearing.

14:56.280 --> 14:57.540
How funny.

14:58.740 --> 15:00.540
I'm the one who's

15:00.540 --> 15:03.880
always worried that you
will give up on me.

15:05.740 --> 15:08.280
That will never happen.

15:11.010 --> 15:14.170
After Michitaka-sama's
death, Teishi-sama

15:14.170 --> 15:18.310
only has the Emperor's love
to protect her in the palace.

15:19.460 --> 15:21.930
It pains me to watch her act cheerful

15:21.930 --> 15:25.350
while shouldering the
fate of her entire clan.

15:28.860 --> 15:31.090
Right now, the behavior

15:31.090 --> 15:33.820
of a lady-in-waiting could
ruin Teishi-sama's reputation.

15:33.820 --> 15:35.550
I cannot allow myself to fall in love.

15:36.150 --> 15:39.410
Besides, people who go
about business as usual

15:39.410 --> 15:41.020
are not our allies.

15:41.750 --> 15:44.590
If I had to decide,
Yukinari-sama would be...

15:45.290 --> 15:46.260
an enemy.

15:47.450 --> 15:48.970
Heading back to the office?

15:50.350 --> 15:51.600
Tadanobu-sama...

15:54.660 --> 15:56.450
The Pillow Book...

15:56.450 --> 15:57.720
It was written by Shonagon?

15:57.950 --> 16:00.460
Yes, ask Shonagon to let you see

16:00.460 --> 16:02.470
the next part, when you get a chance.

16:02.470 --> 16:04.610
She's written down stories
about the palace.

16:05.110 --> 16:07.320
I'm a major character.

16:07.960 --> 16:10.940
Look here.  She speaks very well of me.

16:12.470 --> 16:15.450
I believe that you haven't
visited her in a while.

16:15.450 --> 16:18.880
Yes, I haven't had the opportunity
since taking my new position.

16:18.880 --> 16:21.050
It seems cruel to break
off a friendship because

16:21.050 --> 16:22.480
you don't have an opportunity to meet.

16:22.480 --> 16:24.940
Cruel?  Did Shonagon say something?

16:24.940 --> 16:26.960
No, this is my personal opinion.

16:27.470 --> 16:29.210
Then you should butt out.

16:30.550 --> 16:31.670
You see, Yukinari-kun.

16:32.090 --> 16:36.580
She and I were friends,
but we were using each other.

16:37.550 --> 16:39.470
She understood that.

16:40.240 --> 16:42.730
Take the Pillow Book.

16:43.930 --> 16:45.800
Picture-perfect gentlemen

16:45.800 --> 16:48.720
and ladies who are every bit their match.

16:48.720 --> 16:50.320
We're used as pawns

16:50.320 --> 16:52.700
for making the Empress look good.

16:54.330 --> 16:57.870
And it's not as though I lose
anything in the process.

16:58.330 --> 16:59.870
That defines our relationship.

17:00.940 --> 17:03.340
I told you to become friends,

17:03.340 --> 17:06.250
but you shouldn't seek
anything beyond that.

17:07.630 --> 17:09.620
I would say that you were only friends

17:09.620 --> 17:11.760
because you never sought more.

17:11.760 --> 17:14.310
Ooh, that stung.

17:15.020 --> 17:16.340
Then give it a try.

17:16.990 --> 17:19.900
See if you can convince
her to open her heart.

17:19.900 --> 17:23.960
Your earnest affection may do the trick.

17:26.110 --> 17:29.520
Sei Shonagon-sama, I have a
letter from Yukinari-sama.

17:29.520 --> 17:30.770
Yes.

17:32.780 --> 17:34.770
Oh, a morning-after letter?

17:34.770 --> 17:38.370
I'm sorry to say that there's
no romance between us.

17:38.620 --> 17:41.470
Naturally, given his nature.

17:44.090 --> 17:46.250
I was filled with regret this morning.

17:46.690 --> 17:49.610
I had intended to reminiscence
about old memories with you last night,

17:49.610 --> 17:51.620
but I was forced to
depart at first crow.

17:52.390 --> 17:54.030
He left early in the night.

17:54.030 --> 17:55.920
That is an odd excuse to make.

17:58.310 --> 18:00.590
He can be charming, if he wants to.

18:00.590 --> 18:02.470
If he wasn't so stubborn,

18:02.470 --> 18:04.180
the other ladies would also like him.

18:05.170 --> 18:08.520
I've never heard a bird crow at night,

18:08.950 --> 18:12.220
but I believe there is
such a bird in China.

18:13.000 --> 18:15.430
The hero of Qi, Lord Mengchang,

18:15.430 --> 18:18.490
imitated the crow of a
rooster to trick guards

18:18.490 --> 18:21.900
into opening the gate before dawn.

18:22.530 --> 18:26.480
You were most likely
fooled by a false crow.

18:29.990 --> 18:31.010
I see.

18:31.650 --> 18:33.640
Lord Mengchang opened the gates

18:33.640 --> 18:35.980
of Hangu Pass with his false crow,

18:35.980 --> 18:39.710
but if I would seek to open
any gate in such a way,

18:40.150 --> 18:42.480
it would be the gates of love

18:42.480 --> 18:44.350
between you and me.

18:44.870 --> 18:47.590
This correspondence has taken an odd turn.

18:47.590 --> 18:50.560
I don't believe he would normally
joke about such a subject.

18:50.910 --> 18:54.020
Is he seriously trying to woo me?

18:54.780 --> 18:57.040
You should get together.

18:58.180 --> 19:00.360
Someone must have put him up to this.

19:02.610 --> 19:06.180
As the Empress's lady-in-waiting,
I must respond

19:06.180 --> 19:08.960
with a poem that preserves my dignity.

19:10.660 --> 19:14.790
Said night was young when
the false rooster crowed,

19:14.790 --> 19:17.640
but the gates of Afusaka remained shut.

19:19.020 --> 19:23.040
Your lies will never open
these gates of love,

19:23.040 --> 19:25.800
since I am always on my guard.

19:27.230 --> 19:29.660
This poem may be a little blunt,

19:29.660 --> 19:33.110
but I believe it's more
interesting this way.

19:34.840 --> 19:38.140
Oh, I believe this is the first time I've

19:38.140 --> 19:39.900
written a poem to Yukinari-sama,

19:39.900 --> 19:41.830
since we've been avoiding poetry.

19:42.520 --> 19:45.300
I'm starting to feel
a little embarrassed.

19:45.300 --> 19:47.180
I have Yukinari-sama's response.

19:47.180 --> 19:48.950
What?  That was fast!

19:49.720 --> 19:53.510
The gates of Afusaka are so loose

19:54.300 --> 19:57.260
that they open before the
rooster crows and await entry.

19:58.920 --> 20:00.600
Always on your guard?

20:00.600 --> 20:03.400
Everyone says that you're
easy because you'll spread

20:03.400 --> 20:04.750
your legs for anyone.

20:06.530 --> 20:07.920
What on earth?

20:07.920 --> 20:10.640
He doesn't need to worry
about his skill as a poet,

20:11.860 --> 20:14.810
when he's so insulting and crass.

20:17.560 --> 20:20.120
I worked hard on the poem,

20:20.120 --> 20:21.740
so it's unfortunate that I
never received a response.

20:22.460 --> 20:25.660
What's unfortunate is that
I expected better from you.

20:26.220 --> 20:27.980
It was just a joke.

20:27.980 --> 20:31.370
You went too far for a joke.

20:31.880 --> 20:32.800
Here.

20:32.800 --> 20:34.720
Oh, my pillow book!

20:34.720 --> 20:36.210
Why do you have it?

20:36.560 --> 20:38.280
Tadanobu-sama had it.

20:38.890 --> 20:40.670
Everyone was taking turns reading it.

20:41.030 --> 20:42.750
Oh, dear...

20:42.750 --> 20:44.490
What did they say?

20:44.490 --> 20:45.970
They were pleased,

20:45.970 --> 20:48.030
since they saw no harm in
the praise you gave them.

20:48.030 --> 20:48.640
Huh?

20:50.040 --> 20:51.990
I want you to understand.

20:52.570 --> 20:55.520
I have no ulterior motive in seeking

20:55.520 --> 20:57.650
a close relationship with you.

20:58.130 --> 21:01.400
Our status in society is very different,

21:01.400 --> 21:04.790
but I knew that we could
overcome that barrier.

21:05.380 --> 21:07.670
At least, I hoped we would.

21:08.290 --> 21:11.250
However, it appears that
you don't feel that way.

21:12.040 --> 21:16.080
"Said night was young when the
false rooster crowed," yes?

21:17.480 --> 21:20.330
If you understand that
our status is different,

21:20.330 --> 21:22.570
you should give up on me.

21:22.570 --> 21:24.570
Would you undo our long friendship

21:24.570 --> 21:26.680
if the circumstances were right?

21:28.710 --> 21:30.610
It's very difficult to

21:30.610 --> 21:35.730
overcome status differences
and maintain love and trust.

21:36.640 --> 21:37.620
Yes.

21:38.230 --> 21:43.200
However, a life where you
never find anything to trust

21:43.200 --> 21:45.040
would be the same as death.

21:46.610 --> 21:48.820
Never forget that, Nagiko.

21:49.510 --> 21:53.360
A life without trust would
be the same as death.

21:54.020 --> 21:57.900
His words always move me.

21:57.900 --> 22:00.100
I believe his youth and
honesty are part of it,

22:00.560 --> 22:01.510
but...

22:03.100 --> 22:06.760
In that case, I must make up my mind.

22:08.240 --> 22:10.310
The gates of love may remain shut,

22:10.310 --> 22:13.850
but I'm willing to open
the gates to my heart.

22:16.390 --> 22:19.310
Then let me see your face as proof.

22:19.640 --> 22:22.440
Th-That's a different story!

22:22.440 --> 22:23.440
Why?

22:23.440 --> 22:26.640
Because it'd be too embarrassing now!

22:26.640 --> 22:28.560
You must be ugly.

22:28.560 --> 22:30.080
Then don't show me your face.

22:30.080 --> 22:32.190
I'll never talk to you again!

22:32.910 --> 22:34.950
Poetic Tale 9:

22:32.910 --> 22:34.950
END

24:04.960 --> 25:00.000
Next Episode

24:04.960 --> 25:00.000
Nakoso Falls

24:04.960 --> 25:00.000
Shonagon Kinto

24:07.340 --> 24:11.650
No more can we hear the
sounds of the waterfall,

24:12.290 --> 24:16.020
but its legacy continues to spread.
